    "In this section, you'll learn how simple file upload functions can be used as a powerful vector for a number of high-severity attacks. We'll show you how to bypass common defense mechanisms in order to upload a web shell, enabling you to take full control of a vulnerable web server. Given how common file upload functions are, knowing how to test them properly is essential knowledge." => 'Pada bagian ini, Anda akan mempelajari bagaimana fitur unggah berkas sederhana dapat menjadi vektor serangan berdampak tinggi, termasuk cara melewati mekanisme pertahanan umum untuk mengunggah web shell dan mengendalikan server rentan.',
