    "For example, they may attempt to blacklist dangerous file types, but fail to account for parsing discrepancies when checking the file extensions. As with any blacklist, it's also easy to accidentally omit more obscure file types that may still be dangerous." => 'Misalnya, daftar hitam ekstensi berbahaya kerap mengabaikan ketidaksesuaian parser atau melupakan ekstensi alternatif yang tetap dieksekusi server.',
