    'Many servers also allow developers to create special configuration files within individual directories in order to override or add to one or more of the global settings. Apache servers, for example, will load a directory-specific configuration from a file called [[C0]] if one is present.' => 'Namun banyak server mendukung berkas konfigurasi per direktori, seperti [[C0]] pada Apache.',
