    'Add trailing characters. Some components will strip or ignore trailing whitespaces, dots, and suchlike: [[C0]]' => 'Menambahkan karakter di akhir seperti titik atau spasi yang diabaikan sistem berkas, contohnya [[C0]].',
    "Try using the URL encoding (or double URL encoding) for dots, forward slashes, and backward slashes. If the value isn't decoded when validating the file extension, but is later decoded server-side, this can also allow you to upload malicious files that would otherwise be blocked: [[C0]]" => 'Memakai URL encoding atau double encoding pada titik dan garis miring, seperti [[C0]], agar lolos filter sebelum didekode saat penyimpanan.',
    'Add semicolons or URL-encoded null byte characters before the file extension. If validation is written in a high-level language like PHP or Java, but the server processes the file using lower-level functions in C/C++, for example, this can cause discrepancies in what is treated as the end of the filename: [[C0]] or [[C1]]' => 'Menambahkan titik koma atau null byte sebelum ekstensi tambahan, misalnya [[C0]] atau [[C1]], untuk memutus pembacaan string pada fungsi C/C++.',
    'Try using multibyte unicode characters, which may be converted to null bytes and dots after unicode conversion or normalization. Sequences like [[C0]], [[C1]] or [[C2]] may be translated to [[C3]] if the filename parsed as a UTF-8 string, but then converted to ASCII characters before being used in a path.' => 'Memakai karakter multibyte Unicode seperti [[C0]], [[C1]], atau [[C2]] yang berubah menjadi [[C3]] setelah normalisasi UTF-8 ke ASCII.',
    "Other defenses involve stripping or replacing dangerous extensions to prevent the file from being executed. If this transformation isn't applied recursively, you can position the prohibited string in such a way that removing it still leaves behind a valid file extension. For example, consider what happens if you strip [[C0]] from the following filename:" => 'Jika mekanisme hanya menghapus string [[C0]] satu kali tanpa rekursi, susunan bersarang dapat meninggalkan ekstensi valid sesudah penghapusan:',
