    'If the uploaded file then appears on a page that is visited by other users, their browser will execute the script when it tries to render the page. Note that due to same-origin policy restrictions, these kinds of attacks will only work if the uploaded file is served from the same origin to which you upload it.' => 'Saat pengguna lain membuka berkas tersebut dari origin yang sama, peramban akan mengeksekusi skrip di dalamnya.',
    'Exploiting vulnerabilities in the parsing of uploaded files' => 'Mengeksploitasi kerentanan pada pemrosesan berkas unggahan',
    'If the uploaded file seems to be both stored and served securely, the last resort is to try exploiting vulnerabilities specific to the parsing or processing of different file formats. For example, you know that the server parses XML-based files, such as Microsoft Office [[C0]] or [[C1]] files, this may be a potential vector for XXE injection attacks.' => 'Jika penyimpanan aman, periksa celah pada parser format file itu sendiri; misalnya file berbasis XML seperti [[C0]] atau [[C1]] berpotensi membuka celah XXE.',
    'Uploading files using PUT' => 'Mengunggah berkas menggunakan PUT',
    "It's worth noting that some web servers may be configured to support [[C0]] requests. If appropriate defenses aren't in place, this can provide an alternative means of uploading malicious files, even when an upload function isn't available via the web interface." => 'Sebagian server web mendukung metode HTTP [[C0]]. Jika tidak dibatasi, penyerang dapat mengunggah berkas langsung meski tidak ada formulir unggah di situs.',
    'You can try sending [[C0]] requests to different endpoints to test for any that advertise support for the [[C1]] method.' => 'Coba kirimkan permintaan [[C0]] ke berbagai endpoint untuk mengecek apakah server mengizinkan metode [[C1]].',
    'How to prevent file upload vulnerabilities' => 'Cara mencegah kerentanan file upload',
    "Allowing users to upload files is commonplace and doesn't have to be dangerous as long as you take the right precautions. In general, the most effective way to protect your own websites from these vulnerabilities is to implement all of the following practices:" => 'Fitur unggah berkas dapat aman digunakan selama menerapkan seluruh langkah pengamanan berikut:',
    "Check the file extension against a whitelist of permitted extensions rather than a blacklist of prohibited ones. It's much easier to guess which extensions you might want to allow than it is to guess which ones an attacker might try to upload." => 'Validasi ekstensi berkas memakai daftar putih (whitelist) ekstensi yang diizinkan, bukan daftar hitam.',
    "Make sure the filename doesn't contain any substrings that may be interpreted as a directory or a traversal sequence ([[C0]])." => 'Pastikan nama berkas bebas dari karakter pemisah direktori atau urutan traversal ([[C0]]).',
    'Rename uploaded files to avoid collisions that may cause existing files to be overwritten.' => 'Ubah nama berkas yang diunggah dengan penamaan acak agar tidak menimpa berkas yang sudah ada.',
    "Do not upload files to the server's permanent filesystem until they have been fully validated." => 'Jangan memindahkan berkas ke direktori permanen sebelum seluruh proses validasi dan pemindaian selesai.',
    'As much as possible, use an established framework for preprocessing file uploads rather than attempting to write your own validation mechanisms.' => 'Gunakan mekanisme pemrosesan unggahan bawaan framework yang teruji alih-alih menulis logika validasi sendiri.',
];
